Banyan is an orc and an operative of the [[Org/Actinium Convox/index|Actinium Convox]]. He is short for an orc and stocky, and he dresses for an office: suspenders, a pressed shirt with the sleeves down, a tie, and a puka shell necklace hung with a shark's tooth he says came from a real shark. The tooth is plaster and everyone can tell.

He works the magic of the wild and takes the shapes of beasts, scouting as a bird or meeting a fight as a triceratops.
